<title>JAPAN: Clarke, Mitsuzuka to meet at 0130 GMT on Thursday.</title>
<headline>Clarke, Mitsuzuka to meet at 0130 GMT on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke will meet Japanese Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka from 10.30 a.m. (0130 GMT) on Thursday, a ministry official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>They will discuss problems affecting the economies and financial markets of Japan and Britain.</p>
<p>Clarke will visit Japan from Wednesday to Friday.</p>
</text>
